  - title: 02 / Six bench connections
    explanation: "W01 Battery_positive \u2192 MAIN_IN. W02 MAIN_OUT \u2192 LDR_A.
      W03 LDR_B \u2192 R_DIV_IN. W04 R_DIV_OUT \u2192 Battery_negative. W05 MAIN_OUT
      \u2192 Motor_A. W06 Motor_B \u2192 Battery_negative."
    caption: USE THE TERMINAL LABELS ON THE WORKBENCH
    parts:
