  - title: 03 / Calibrate the divider
    explanation: Read each reference tile. More reflected light lowers LDR resistance
      and raises SENSE. The sorter uses DARK at or below 1.5 V, BRIGHT at or above
      3.5 V, and REVIEW between them.
    caption: "DARK \u2248 0.83 V \u2022 BORDERLINE \u2248 2.50 V \u2022 BRIGHT \u2248
      4.32 V"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.49}
      label: 5 V
      color: {r: 0.97, g: 0.29, b: 0.35, a: 1}
    - id: main
