  - title: 04 / Reject glare
    explanation: The brief bright pulse lasts 0.12 s and cannot qualify. The sensor
      must read the same band for 0.24 s before the gate locks a route. With no stable
      result, the gate sends the part to REVIEW. Finish with all six mixed parts
      in the correct bins.
    caption: REQUIRE 0.24 S IN ONE BAND INSIDE THE INSPECTION WINDOW
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.49}
      label: 5 V
      color: {r: 0.97, g: 0.29, b: 0.35, a: 1}
    - id: main
      kind: 5
